1
00:00:00,618 --> 00:00:01,588
Seribu tahun kurang lima

2
00:00:01,608 --> 00:00:02,455
puluh.

3
00:00:02,475 --> 00:00:04,127
Selama itu Nabi Nuh tinggal

4
00:00:04,147 --> 00:00:05,551
bersama kaumnya dan menyeru

5
00:00:05,571 --> 00:00:06,261
mereka.

6
00:00:06,281 --> 00:00:07,608
Hasilnya, hanya sedikit yang

7
00:00:07,628 --> 00:00:08,600
beriman.

8
00:00:08,620 --> 00:00:10,241
Angka itu tertulis di surah

9
00:00:10,261 --> 00:00:12,130
Al-'Ankabut ayat empat belas.

10
00:00:12,150 --> 00:00:14,328
Nuh menyeru siang dan malam,

11
00:00:14,348 --> 00:00:16,290
terang-terangan dan diam-diam.

12
00:00:16,310 --> 00:00:17,760
Tapi kaumnya menyumbat telinga

13
00:00:17,780 --> 00:00:18,937
dengan jari,

14
00:00:18,957 --> 00:00:20,531
dan menutupi wajah dengan

15
00:00:20,551 --> 00:00:21,121
baju.

16
00:00:21,141 --> 00:00:22,940
Para pemuka kaumnya mengejek:

17
00:00:22,960 --> 00:00:24,473
kamu cuma manusia biasa,

18
00:00:24,493 --> 00:00:26,331
dan pengikutmu orang-orang

19
00:00:26,351 --> 00:00:27,048
rendahan.

20
00:00:27,068 --> 00:00:27,822
Nuh menjawab:

21
00:00:27,842 --> 00:00:29,076
aku tidak meminta harta

22
00:00:29,096 --> 00:00:29,803
darimu.

23
00:00:29,823 --> 00:00:31,150
Upahku hanya dari Allah.

24
00:00:31,170 --> 00:00:32,713
Lalu Allah memerintahkan:

25
00:00:32,733 --> 00:00:33,735
buatlah kapal,

26
00:00:33,755 --> 00:00:35,283
di bawah pengawasan Kami.

27
00:00:35,303 --> 00:00:36,916
Nuh mulai membangun.

28
00:00:36,936 --> 00:00:38,201
Setiap kali pemuka kaumnya

29
00:00:38,221 --> 00:00:39,803
lewat, mereka mengejeknya.

30
00:00:39,823 --> 00:00:41,255
Surah Al-Qamar menyebut,

31
00:00:41,275 --> 00:00:42,773
kapal itu terbuat dari papan

32
00:00:42,793 --> 00:00:43,462
dan pasak.

33
00:00:43,482 --> 00:00:44,994
Ketika perintah Allah datang,

34
00:00:45,014 --> 00:00:46,310
pintu-pintu langit terbuka

35
00:00:46,330 --> 00:00:47,595
dengan air yang tercurah,

36
00:00:47,615 --> 00:00:48,942
dan bumi menyemburkan mata

37
00:00:48,962 --> 00:00:49,923
air.

38
00:00:49,943 --> 00:00:51,566
Nuh memuat sepasang dari

39
00:00:51,586 --> 00:00:52,494
setiap jenis hewan,

40
00:00:52,514 --> 00:00:53,934
dan orang-orang beriman.

41
00:00:53,954 --> 00:00:55,513
Naiklah, dengan nama Allah,

42
00:00:55,533 --> 00:00:56,850
saat berlayar dan berlabuh.

43
00:00:56,870 --> 00:00:58,015
Kapal itu berlayar di tengah

44
00:00:58,035 --> 00:00:59,694
gelombang setinggi gunung.

45
00:00:59,714 --> 00:01:01,343
Nuh memanggil anaknya:

46
00:01:01,363 --> 00:01:02,757
naiklah bersama kami.

47
00:01:02,777 --> 00:01:03,758
Anaknya menjawab:

48
00:01:03,778 --> 00:01:05,548
aku akan berlindung ke gunung.

49
00:01:05,568 --> 00:01:06,988
Gelombang pun memisahkan

50
00:01:07,008 --> 00:01:07,599
mereka.

51
00:01:07,619 --> 00:01:09,023
Lalu difirmankan:

52
00:01:09,043 --> 00:01:09,766
wahai bumi,

53
00:01:09,786 --> 00:01:10,942
telanlah airmu,

54
00:01:10,962 --> 00:01:11,608
wahai langit,

55
00:01:11,628 --> 00:01:12,441
berhentilah.

56
00:01:12,461 --> 00:01:13,045
Air surut,

57
00:01:13,065 --> 00:01:14,253
dan kapal berlabuh di atas

58
00:01:14,273 --> 00:01:15,158
bukit Judi.

59
00:01:15,178 --> 00:01:17,014
Kapal itu dijadikan tanda.

60
00:01:17,034 --> 00:01:18,051
Adakah yang mau mengambil

61
00:01:18,071 --> 00:01:18,786
pelajaran?

62
00:01:18,806 --> 00:01:20,226
Hampir seribu tahun menyeru,

63
00:01:20,246 --> 00:01:21,557
Nuh tidak berhenti walau

64
00:01:21,577 --> 00:01:22,904
ditertawakan.

65
00:01:22,924 --> 00:01:23,709
Menurut kamu,

66
00:01:23,729 --> 00:01:24,916
berapa lama kamu sanggup

67
00:01:24,936 --> 00:01:26,590
bertahan pada hal yang benar?

